<title>UK: SBC sets call, put warrants on Swiss Govt bonds.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call, put warrants on Swiss Govt bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said it has issued a total of six million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the 4.5 percent Swiss Fed bond due April 8, 2006.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.FEB.97-15.SEP.97   PAYMENT DATE 07.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   EBS			 MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  105.61 PCT</p>
<p> * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	 STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  103.0 PCT   2.89 CHF   0.27 PCT   36.54 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	  105.0 PCT   1.15 CHF   0.85 PCT   69.94 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	  107.0 PCT   0.77 CHF   2.05 PCT  137.16 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT A	  100.0 PCT   0.55 CHF   5.83 PCT  192.02 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT B	  103.0 PCT   1.55 CHF   3.94 PCT   68.14 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT C	  105.0 PCT   2.63 CHF   3.07 PCT   40.16 TIMES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
